	(text "Bay slots are PCI Express x1 sockets used with the bay-card pinout (symgen SLOT_PINS), not PCIe signalling. Five contacts each for 12 V and 5 V (about 1 A per contact), grounds beside every pair. v1 populates cards in slots 1-4; slots 5-8 take cards later (bigger brick, D9)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 276 0)
		(effects
